# Lexsys agent mode (override)

**OVERRIDE:** This repo uses **Lexsys router**, not agent-developer default ("run checks myself").

## Forbidden unless the user explicitly asks

- Shell / `pnpm` for `*:check`, `*:test`, `pnpm check`, `format:check`, `format`, `registry:sync`, `vitest`
- Marking verification or PR tables as "passed" without user **`verify passed`**
- `git commit`, `git push`, `gh pr create`, ff `main` without [`$monorepo-verify-gate` § Format gate](../skills/monorepo-verify-gate/SKILL.md#format-gate-mandatory--blocks-git-write)

## Default ritual

1. Implement → [`$monorepo-verify-gate`](../skills/monorepo-verify-gate/SKILL.md) → numbered checklist
2. **User runs** commands → **`verify passed`** (`pnpm format:check` last before git)
3. User requests git → [`$git-commit`](../skills/git-commit/SKILL.md)

`commit` / `PR` without prior verify → [format fallback](../skills/monorepo-verify-gate/SKILL.md#format-fallback-step-5-only); **stop** until green.

